      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (2) the following subsections: “(2a) In appointing a person under paragraph (2)(b), the Board shall have regard to the person’s integrity, reputation, knowledge, skills and experience, which will enable him to discharge his functions as a member of the Board committee. (2b) The functions of a Board committee established under subsection (1) shall be determined by the Board.”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_21__para_e",
