      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "this Act;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_5__list_2__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_5__list_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the Capital Markets and Services Act 2007;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_5__list_2__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_5__list_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the Securities Industry (Central Depositories) Act 1991 [Act 453];"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_5__list_2__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_5__list_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "any other legislation which the Commission is empowered to administer or enforce; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_5__list_2__para_e",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "e",
      "hasPart": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_5__list_2__para_e__subpara_cc",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_5__list_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "any other regulations, rules, orders, notifications or other subsidiary legislation made under paragraphs (a), (b), (c) and (d);’; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_5__list_2__para_e__subpara_cc",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "cc",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_5__list_2__para_e",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after the definition of “Fund” the following definitions: ‘ “Islamic capital market business or transaction” means— (a) the business of carrying any regulated activity; (b) any proposal, scheme, transaction, arrangement, activity or matter relating to any capital market product, or under Part IIIA or Part VI of the Capital Markets and Services Act 2007; (c) any transaction relating to a derivative; or (d) the establishing, operating or maintaining of a securities market or a derivatives market, which is consistent with the principles of Shariah as may be determined by the Shariah Advisory Council;’. Amendment of section 2a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_6",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_6__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_6__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_6__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 2a of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_60",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "60",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_60__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_60__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 152a of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_60__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_60",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for paragraph (b) the following paragraph: “ (b) any rulings issued under the securities laws;”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_60__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_60",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph (g), by inserting after the word “action” the words “or measure”. Substitution of section 160"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_61",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "61",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by substituting for section 160 the following section: “Immunity 160. No action, suit, prosecution or other proceeding shall lie or be brought, instituted, or maintained in any court or before any other authority against— (a) the Commission; (b) any person who is or has been— (i) a member of the Board, Shariah Advisory Council, Audit Oversight Board, Capital Market Development Fund or Capital Market Compensation Fund Corporation, or any committee established by the Commission, Shariah Advisory Council, Audit Oversight Board, Capital Market Development Fund or Capital Market Compensation Fund Corporation; or (ii) an officer of the Commission; or (c) any person engaged by the Commission under section 145, for or on account of, or in respect of, any act done or statement made, omitted to be done or made by the persons specified in paragraphs (a), (b) or (c), in the performance of their functions, in the administration of the securities laws or in the exercise of any power conferred, whether expressed or implied, by or under any securities laws: Provided that such act, statement, performance of functions or exercise of power was done or made, in good faith.”. New section 160a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_62",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "62",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 160 the following section: “Power to issue directions to discharge Government’s international obligation under United Nations Security Council Resolutions 160a. (1) Where the Security Council of the United Nations decides, in pursuant to the Charter of the United Nations, on measures to be employed to give effect to any of its decisions and calls upon the Government of Malaysia to apply such measures, the Commission may, in relation to the measures that are within the functions of the Commission, issue directions in writing to any persons licensed, registered, approved, recognized or authorized under any securities laws, to enable those measures to be effectively applied. (2) A direction issued under subsection (1) may include, but not be limited to a direction to freeze securities accounts, monies and assets. (3) A person to whom a direction is issued under subsection (1) shall comply with the direction notwithstanding any other duty imposed on the said person by any contract or law or international agreement. (4) A person who carries out any act in compliance with the directions issued under subsection (1), shall not be treated as being in breach of any such contract or law or international agreement. (5) This section does not apply to a registered person as specified in the Third Column of Part 1 of Schedule 4 to the Capital Markets and Services Act 2007. (6) A person who fails to comply with any direction issued under this section shall be guilty of an offence.”. Substitution of Schedule 1"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_63",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "63",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by substituting for Schedule 1 the following Schedule: “SCHEDULE 1 Part 1 [Section 2] (a) a public listed company or a corporation listed on the stock exchange; (b) a bank licensed under the Financial Services Act 2013 [Act 758]; (c) an insurer licensed under the Financial Services Act 2013; (d) a takaful operator licensed under the Islamic Financial Services Act 2013 [Act 759]; (e) an Islamic bank licensed under the Islamic Financial Services Act 2013 [Act 759]; (f) a financial institution prescribed under section 212 or 223 of the Financial Services Act 2013; (g) a development financial institution prescribed under the Development Financial Institutions Act 2002 [Act 618]; (h) a holder of the Capital Markets Services Licence for the carrying on of the regulated activities of dealing in securities, dealing in derivatives or fund management; (i) an exchange holding company approved under the securities laws; (j) an exchange approved under the securities laws; (k) a central depository approved under the securities laws; (l) a clearing house approved under the securities laws; (m) a self-regulatory organization recognized under the securities laws; (n) a private retirement scheme administrator approved under the securities laws; (o) a trade repository approved under the securities laws; (p) the Capital Market Compensation Fund Corporation; (q) any other person as the Minister may prescribe by order published in the Gazette. Part 2 (a) a private retirement scheme approved by the Commission under the Capital Markets and Services Act 2007; (b) a unit trust scheme approved, authorized or recognized by the Commission under the Capital Markets and Services Act 2007; (c) any other capital market funds as may be specified by the Commission.”. Saving and transitional"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_64",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "64",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_64__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_64__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_64__subsec_3",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_64__subsec_4",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_64__subsec_5",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_64__subsec_6",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_64__subsec_7",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_64__subsec_8"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_64__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_64",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "For the purposes of this section— “effective date” means the relevant date of coming into operation of this Act or the respective provisions of this Act; “repealed Part” means Part IXa of the Capital Markets and Services Act 2007 before the effective date; “repealed sections” means sections 316a, 316b, 316c, 316d, 316e, 316f, 316g and 316h of the Capital Markets and Services Act 2007 before the effective date."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_64__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_64__subsec_2__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_64__subsec_2__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_64__subsec_2__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_64__subsec_2__para_d",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_64__subsec_2__para_e",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_64__subsec_2__para_f"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_64",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "In respect of the Commission—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_64__subsec_2__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_64__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the change of name from the “Securities Commission” to the “Securities Commission Malaysia” shall not affect any powers, rights, privileges, liabilities, duties or obligations of the Securities Commission, or render defective any legal proceedings by or against it;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_64__subsec_2__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_64__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "any legal proceedings that could not have been continued or commenced by or against the Securities Commission before the effective date may be continued or commenced on or after the effective date in the name of the Securities Commission Malaysia;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_64__subsec_2__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_64__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "all regulations, orders, directions, notifications, exemptions and other subsidiary legislation, howsoever called, made, given or done by the Commission before the effective date shall be deemed to have been made, given or done by the Securities Commission Malaysia, and shall continue to remain in full force and effect;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_64__subsec_2__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_64__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "all approvals, directions, notices, guidelines, circulars, guidance notes, practice notes, rulings, decisions, notifications, exemptions and other executive acts, howsoever called, given, made or done by the Commission before the effective date shall be deemed to have been given, made or done by the Securities Commission Malaysia, and shall continue to remain in full force and effect;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_64__subsec_2__para_e",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "e",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_64__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "any application for an approval or consent, or for any other purpose whatsoever, or any appeal relating to such application, made by any person to the Minister or to the Commission before the effective date, and pending immediately before the effective date, shall, if there is a corresponding provision in the principal Act as amended by this Act, be dealt with as if it was made under that provision and, if there is no such corresponding provision, such application or appeal shall lapse on the effective date; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_64__subsec_2__para_f",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "f",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_64__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "all monies contained in or due to be paid to the Fund established under section 23 of the principal Act under the administration and control of the Securities Commission shall, on the effective date, be deemed to be under the administration and control of the Securities Commission Malaysia."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_64__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_64",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Nothing in this Act shall affect any person’s liability to be prosecuted or punished for offences or breaches committed under the securities laws before the effective date or any proceeding brought, sentence imposed or action taken before such date in respect of such offence or breach."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_64__subsec_4",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_64",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any right, privilege, obligation or liability acquired, accrued or incurred before the effective date or any legal proceedings, remedy or investigation in respect of such right, privilege, obligation or liability shall not be affected by this Act and shall continue to remain in force as if this Act had not been enacted."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_64__subsec_5",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_64__subsec_5__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_64__subsec_5__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_64",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "In respect of the Shariah Advisory Council—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_64__subsec_5__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_64__subsec_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the Shariah Advisory Council established under the repealed sections and its members appointed under the same repealed sections shall be deemed to be established and appointed, as the case may be, under or in accordance with the principal Act as amended by this Act; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_64__subsec_5__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_64__subsec_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "any decision or ruling made by the Shariah Advisory Council established under the repealed sections shall be deemed to have been validly made under the principal Act as amended by this Act and shall continue to remain in full force and effect in relation to the person to whom it applies until amended."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_64__subsec_6",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_64",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where in any written law, any reference is made to any specific provision of the repealed Part, it shall be construed as a reference to a provision of the principal Act as amended by this Act which corresponds as nearly as may be to such specific provision."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_64__subsec_7",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "7",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_64",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Nothing in the repealed Part or repealed sections shall affect any person’s liability to be prosecuted or punished for offences or breaches committed under the repealed Part or repealed sections before the effective date or any proceeding brought, sentence imposed or action taken before such date in respect of such offence or breach."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_64__subsec_8",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "8",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_64",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any right, privilege, obligation or liability acquired, accrued or incurred before the effective date or any legal proceedings, remedy or investigation in respect of such right, privilege, obligation or liability shall not be affected by this Act and shall continue to remain in force as if this Act had not been enacted."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_6__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the shoulder note, by deleting the words ‘and “securities law” ’;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_6__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the words ‘Any reference in this Act to “this Act” or a “securities law” ’ the words ‘Any reference in this Act to “this Act” ’; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_6__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the words “subsidiary legislation made under this Act or a securities law, as the case may be” the words “subsidiary legislation made under this Act”. Amendment of section 2g"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_7",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "7",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 2g of the principal Act is amended by substituting for subsection (1) the following subsection: “(1) Where under any of the provisions of the securities laws, power is given to the Commission— (a) to inspect and make copies of or take extracts from any book required under any of the provisions of the securities laws to be kept or maintained; or (b) to require any person, or where any person is required under the securities laws, to submit to the Commission any information, document or book, the Commission shall have access to the same and may— (A) require that the same be submitted within such period, at such intervals, in such manner, in such form, and in writing or by means of any visual recording, whether of still or moving images, or sound recording, or any electronic, magnetic, mechanical or other recording whatsoever, on any substance, material, thing or article, as the Commission may set out in the specification; (B) obtain clear reproductions in writing; or (C) copy or move it to a storage or recording device.”. Substitution of section 4"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_8",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "8",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by substituting for section 4 the following section: “Board of Commission 4. (1) There shall be a Board of the Commission. (2) The Board shall consist of the following members who shall be appointed by the Minister: (a) a Chairman; (b) a Deputy Chief Executive; and (c) seven other members, who may include persons representing the government and private sector. (3) The Board shall— (a) be responsible for monitoring the overall governance of the Commission; (b) be responsible for reviewing and approving the strategic plan and budget of the Commission; (c) be responsible for reviewing and adopting appropriate systems and controls to manage the enterprise risks of the Commission; (d) have oversight of the affairs and business of the Commission and keep under constant review the performance of the Commission in giving effect to its objects, carrying out its functions and the use of the financial resources of the Commission; and (e) be responsible for such other matters as may be provided under the securities laws. (4) A member of the Board shall at all times act honestly and in the best interest of the Commission and use reasonable diligence in the discharge of his functions. (5) A member of the Board shall not make improper use of any information acquired or exercise any improper influence by virtue of his position to gain directly or indirectly an advantage for himself or for any other person.”. New sections 4a and 4b"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@/~cl_9",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "9",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/14/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 4 the following sections: “Appointment of members of Board 4a. (1) A person to be appointed as the Chairman or the Deputy Chief Executive under section 4 shall be a person of integrity and impeccable reputation with proven experience and recognized knowledge in the financial or capital markets. (2) The Minister, in appointing other members of the Board under subsection 4(2), shall have regard to— (a) diversity of the Board members in terms of interest, knowledge, skills and experience; and (b) the person’s probity and standing and his knowledge, skills and experience in law, economics, finance, accounting or in any other relevant discipline, which will enable him to discharge his functions as a member of the Board. Chairman and Deputy Chief Executive 4b. (1) The Chairman shall be entrusted with the day-to- day administration and management of the Commission and may, unless otherwise provided under the securities laws or any other written law, exercise all powers and do all acts which may be exercised or done by the Commission under the securities laws or any other written law. (2) During the absence of the Chairman or inability of the Chairman to act due to any cause, the Deputy Chief Executive shall carry out the functions of the Chairman. (3) For the purposes of subsection (2), in the case where the Deputy Chief Executive is absent or unable to act due to any cause, a senior member of management of the Commission designated by the Board shall carry out the functions of the Chairman. (4) Notwithstanding subsection (1), the Chairman may bring any matter in relation to the Commission’s functions to the Board for deliberation or direction, where he deems it necessary.”. Substitution of section 5"
      }
    }
  ]
}
